        "created_at": "2017-08-19T12:34:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The community has discovered the unlock condition for Trickster Kismet:</p><p><strong><span>Lose a game against regular Kismet in The Block, with at least K.N.Y.F.E., The Argent Adept, and Fanatic on the team. Over the course of the game, the Talisman must spend more full turns in hero play areas than full turns in the villain play area.</span></strong></p>",
